## Scope (Engine-Specific)
SPECTRA performs deterministic spectral measurement on sealed numeric inputs:
- FFT / rFFT
- PSD (Welch / periodogram) with deterministic windowing
- Cross-spectrum and coherence
- STFT (deterministic hop/window)
- Band energy and spectral centroids
- Transfer functions (two-channel inputs)

## Prohibitions (Engine-Specific)
SPECTRA MUST NOT:
- invent data
- infer identity, intent, attribution, or causation
- emit classification, conclusions, or directives (vertical lens only)
- accept peer delivery
